1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,197
June had rehearsed all morning.

2
00:00:02,197 --> 00:00:04,922
When she saw Milo in the audience,

3
00:00:04,922 --> 00:00:07,258
she gave him a little wave.

4
00:00:07,917 --> 00:00:11,341
Hi, everyone. If I forget my lines,

5
00:00:11,341 --> 00:00:14,277
please enjoy this very professional scarf.

6
00:00:14,958 --> 00:00:18,162
Milo laughed. So did June. Suddenly,

7
00:00:18,162 --> 00:00:21,366
the room felt a little smaller.
